  "schema": "discover/v0",
  "title": "Applied butterfly multiplication",
  "summary": "Turning integer-multiplication theory into measured, exactly checked speedups of complete operations in FLINT: about 3% for large-integer squaring, 4–15% for polynomial matrix products, and 4–9% for theta evaluation, so far on one Apple M2.",
